  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Hi &nbsp; all，</p><p>《次元小镇》活动于2月1日0点-2月5日24点上线，现同步Day4数据情况：</p><p>具体数据如下：<br /><strong>1、活动目标完成情况：</strong></p><p>活动目标：活动钻石消耗达<span>&nbsp;2000</span>万钻石<br />目标完成度：截止到目前，活动消耗达1684万钻石，目标完成度为84%；</p><table class=\"wrapped relative-table\" style=\"width: 22.2023%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 24.5193%;\" /><col style=\"width: 23.3085%;\" /><col style=\"width: 24.5193%;\" /><col style=\"width: 27.5464%;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><td class=\"highlight-grey\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>次元小镇</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" style=\"text-align: left;\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>活动消耗</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>活动目标</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>目标完成度</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">20260201</td><td>4175721</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">6000000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">70%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">20260202</td><td>2918561</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">6000000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">49%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">20260203</td><td>2879444</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">6000000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">48%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">20260204</td><td>3754146</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">6000000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">63%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">20260205</td><td><br /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">6000000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">合计</td><td>13727872</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">30000000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">46%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><strong>2、大盘数据情况：</strong></p><p>活动消耗占比大盘消耗的9.36%，专属礼物消耗占比大盘礼物消耗的17.26%。</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><br /></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>主板消耗&nbsp;</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>礼物消耗</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>活动消耗</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>礼物消耗</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>&nbsp; 小映礼物消耗</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>活动占主板</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>礼物消耗占比</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>20260201</strong></td><td>44006821</td><td>24408944</td><td>4175721</td><td>4175721</td><td>0</td><td>9.49%</td><td>17.11%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>20260202</strong></td><td>33527903</td><td>18194707</td><td>2918561</td><td>2918561</td><td>0</td><td>8.70%</td><td>16.04%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>20260203</strong></td><td>33325590</td><td>17393868</td><td>2879444</td><td>2879444</td><td>0</td><td>8.64%</td><td>16.55%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>20260204</strong></td><td>35794727</td><td>19525734</td><td>3754146</td><td>3754146</td><td>0</td><td>10.49%</td><td>19.23%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>20260205</strong></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>合计</strong></td><td>146655041</td><td>79523253</td><td>13727872</td><td>13727872</td><td>0</td><td>9.36%</td><td>17.26%</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p>主播收礼：</p><p>全部礼物，派对和秀场主播的收礼占比为：75 : 25。</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">场景</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">20260201</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">20260202</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">20260203</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">20260204</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">总计</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">占比</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>派对</strong></td><td>2787359</td><td>2311859</td><td>2168207</td><td>2931710</td><td>10199135</td><td>74.60%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>秀场</strong></td><td>1388362</td><td>550798</td><td>711237</td><td>822436</td><td>3472833</td><td>25.40%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>整体</strong></td><td>4175721</td><td>2862657</td><td>2879444</td><td>3754146</td><td>13671968</td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p><strong>3、各层级主播收礼数据</strong></p><p>派对侧收礼的主播主要集中BN层级，秀场侧收礼的主播主要集中在B层级。</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">主播61天动态层级</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">派对</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">占比</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">秀场</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong title=\"\">占比</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>A</td><td>260091</td><td>1.90%</td><td>316325</td><td>2.31%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B</td><td>1978920</td><td>14.47%</td><td>1624158</td><td>11.88%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B-</td><td>1301455</td><td>9.52%</td><td>287964</td><td>2.11%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>C</td><td>1770607</td><td>12.95%</td><td>304174</td><td>2.22%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>D</td><td>568783</td><td>4.16%</td><td>78815</td><td>0.58%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>N</td><td>2779318</td><td>20.33%</td><td>13263</td><td>0.10%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>S</td><td>1539961</td><td>11.26%</td><td>848134</td><td>6.20%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>10199135</td><td>74.60%</td><td>3472833</td><td>25.40%</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><strong>4、各层级用户送礼数据</strong></p><p>派对侧送礼的用户主要集中BD层级，秀场侧送礼的用户主要集中在BD层级。</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong>用户25日动态层级</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong>派对</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong>占比</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong>秀场</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-#f4f5f7\" data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\"><strong>占比</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>A</td><td>418196</td><td>3.05%</td><td>191322</td><td>1.39%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B</td><td>2897134</td><td>21.10%</td><td>1366239</td><td>9.95%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>C</td><td>1505679</td><td>10.97%</td><td>433660</td><td>3.16%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>D</td><td>2855386</td><td>20.80%</td><td>724650</td><td>5.28%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>E</td><td>1609577</td><td>11.72%</td><td>246331</td><td>1.79%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>F</td><td>353257</td><td>2.57%</td><td>59188</td><td>0.43%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>N</td><td>149908</td><td>1.09%</td><td>80823</td><td>0.59%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>S</td><td>409998</td><td>2.99%</td><td>426524</td><td>3.11%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>10199135</td><td>74.30%</td><td>3528737</td><td>25.70%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p>以上，如有问题及时沟通～</p><p><br /></p>",
